Feature: PetStore API CRUD Operations\n  As a developer\n  I want to automate CRUD operations for the PetStore API\n  So that I can ensure the API works as expected\n\n  Background:\n    Given the API endpoint is \"https://petstore.swagger.io/v2\"\n\n  @create\n  Scenario: Create a new pet\n    When I send a POST request with the following data:\n      | id   | name    | status  |\n      | 101  | Fluffy  | active  |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should contain \"Fluffy\"\n\n  @read\n  Scenario: Retrieve a pet by ID\n    Given the pet ID is \"101\"\n    When I send a GET request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should contain \"Fluffy\"\n\n  @update\n  Scenario: Update an existing pet\n    When I send a PUT request with the following data:\n      | id   | name    | status  |\n      | 101  | Fluffy  | sold    |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should contain \"sold\"\n\n  @delete\n  Scenario: Delete a pet by ID\n    Given the pet ID is \"101\"\n    When I send a DELETE request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should contain \"Pet deleted\"\n\n  @negative\n  Scenario: Retrieve a non-existent pet\n    Given the pet ID is \"9999\"\n    When I send a GET request\n    Then the response status code should be 404\n    And the response body should contain \"Pet not found\"